## Real Capture Attempts

### First attempt — failed closed, no artifact

The command used the supplied absolute read-only readiness and sealed bundle inputs and the worktree-local output. Duration: 15.1 seconds.

It evaluated only the two discovery folds, then failed before persistence with:

```text
ValueError: captured fold effective policy differs from readiness
```

Metadata-only diagnosis (no replay) found exactly one differing effective-policy leaf:

- Authenticated readiness: `entry_policy.signal_every_n_days.value = 1`
- Initial capture harness simulator default: `5`
- Readiness digest: `deb22b16752fc293adbd3aa64f087d39876c3573e651bd3651821ba76c077f39`
- Incorrect harness digest: `81622e4707e4657ecb7793d1b8b476e51edf2296b32866316a21eb9ae4ddbc3c`

No reference file existed after this failure. The controller then explicitly authorized exactly one corrected retry and prohibited a third attempt.

### Corrected retry — succeeded

The corrected capture ran from clean committed HEAD `032a4304b819768a547e6bf4297ed118323abd35`. Duration: 27.7 seconds.

Output:

```text
PIT_POLICY_PARITY_REFERENCE sha256=12afddb213b95f63fc72d5278f4ebda7d60a5dd0a48022bde932b7f61b541dad discovery=discovery_1:2021-06-25..2021-09-20,discovery_2:2021-09-21..2021-12-14 hidden_unevaluated=hidden_1:2021-12-15..2022-03-11
```

Artifact:

- Path: `C:\Projects\trading_bot\RS-momentum-EMA-trading-bot\.worktrees\pit-optimizer-implementation\.artifacts\pit-policy-parity-v2\reference.json`
- SHA-256: `12afddb213b95f63fc72d5278f4ebda7d60a5dd0a48022bde932b7f61b541dad`
- Fold-manifest SHA-256: `1ed07bde7cc358f67f8f2e88c7f13de43ecd01467e954f540f40c3879b503aac`
- Universe count: 25
- Discovery fold 1: 60 sessions, 60 equity points, nested evidence SHA-256 `017f3a9213622bed8b70743e2956d5bab309cae0c46eae5eefd85842541d4561`
- Discovery fold 2: 60 sessions, 60 equity points, nested evidence SHA-256 `de8f04c8c9201cec44169c2ee1a7f5c946d9b68e25417308ca8854d7e9fa498b`
- Hidden fold: exactly 60 sealed session labels; no hidden `ParityFoldEvidence` exists.

The module loader recomputed and verified the artifact digest, fold-manifest digest, and both nested evidence digests. `Get-FileHash` independently returned the same artifact byte hash. `git check-ignore -v` confirmed `.gitignore:34:.artifacts/`; the reference was not added to Git.

## Prohibited-Path Confirmation

- No hidden price, return, trade, baseline metric, or objective value was evaluated or inspected.
- The only hidden-period access was the permitted bundle query of `SPY.trade_date` session labels used to seal `FoldSpec.sessions`.
- No provider client, OpenRouter call, network data fetch, or provider retry was invoked.
- No Docker command or process was invoked.
- No long/full replay was invoked; only the two fixed 60-session discovery folds were evaluated per attempt.
- No upload, push, merge, cloud action, or original-checkout write occurred.
- The readiness and 68 MB sealed bundle were read in place by absolute path and were not copied.

